request.description:
Returns aggregated pipeline KPIs for dashboards.

**Response example:**
```json
{
  "vulnerabilities": {
    "total": 42, "detected": 5, "inProgress": 3,
    "fixGenerated": 2, "prRaised": 8, "resolved": 20,
    "escalated": 3, "failed": 1
  },
  "fixes": {
    "total": 35, "byModel": { "gpt-4o": 20, "qwen2:7b": 10, "llama3:8b": 5 },
    "avgConfidence": 0.912
  },
  "remediationRate": 0.714
}
```

Aggregated LLM spend for the last N days.

**Response example:**
```json
{
  "totalCostUsd": 1.42,
  "totalTokens": 284000,
  "days": 7,
  "byModel": [
    { "model": "gpt-4o", "costUsd": 1.38, "tokens": 276000 },
    { "model": "qwen2:7b", "costUsd": 0.00, "tokens": 8000 }
  ]
}
```
